flowchart TD

    A([ProcessTask Started])
    A --> B{{Wait for Packet<br/>xQueueReceive}}

    B -->|Packet Received| C[Convert packet.text to String]
    C --> D[Extract first character]
    D --> E{Packet Type?}

    %% --------------------------
    %% Temperature Packet
    %% --------------------------
    E -->|T| T1[Parse ROM Address]
    T1 --> T2[Parse Temperature °C]
    T2 --> T3[Convert °C to °F]
    T3 --> T4{ROM matches<br/>Configured Table?}

    T4 -->|Yes| T5[Store Temperature]
    T5 --> T6[Set temperatureDetected=true]

    T4 -->|No| T7[Print Unassigned ROM]

    T6 --> T8[Add ROM to Unique List]
    T7 --> T8

    T8 --> T9[Update RSSI]
    T9 --> T10[Update lastPacketTime]
    T10 --> T11[Reset runningTimer]
    T11 --> T12[Sender State = Awake]
    T12 --> Z

    %% --------------------------
    %% Data Packet
    %% --------------------------
    E -->|D| D1[Parse Battery Voltage]
    D1 --> D2[Parse Sender Version]
    D2 --> D3[Parse Sleep Time]
    D3 --> D4[Parse OLED Flag]
    D4 --> D5[Parse Debug Flag]
    D5 --> D6[Parse Water Sensors]
    D6 --> D7[Parse Sender CPU Temp]

    D7 --> D8{Receiver Variables<br/>Match Sender?}

    D8 -->|No| D9[resetVariablesFlag=true]
    D8 -->|Yes| D10[No Action]

    D9 --> D11
    D10 --> D11

    D11[Update Battery Voltage]
    D11 --> D12[Update RSSI]
    D12 --> D13[Reset runningTimer]
    D13 --> D14[Sender State = Awake]

    D14 --> D15[senderSeenFlag = true]
    D15 --> D16[lastDataPacketTime = millis]
    D16 --> D17[previousDataPacketTime = runningDataPacketTimer]
    D17 --> D18[runningDataPacketTimer = 0]
    D18 --> D19[senderFailedFlag = false]
    D19 --> Z

    %% --------------------------
    %% Other Packet
    %% --------------------------
    E -->|Other| Z

    %% --------------------------
    %% Sleep Check
    %% --------------------------
    Z --> S1{Last Packet >20 sec?}

    S1 -->|Yes| S2{Already Asleep?}

    S2 -->|No| S3[Sender State = Asleep]
    S2 -->|Yes| B

    S3 --> B

    S1 -->|No| B
